{"ts":1780481955749,"state_hash":"f1c254e3789eecad","passage":"Start","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Last Call\n\nNina inherits The Last Call, her late uncle's failing dive bar — and the debt he owed to the man who really owns the block. The bartender came with the building and knows where every body is buried. A regular with money keeps tipping like he's buying something. The cook runs the kitchen like it's hers. The supplier sets his own terms. And every week, the collector knocks. Keep the lights on, or lose the only thing she's got left.\n\nWe're a small indie studio crafting intimate, story-driven experiences. Every game is made with care, and your support helps us keep creating. If you enjoy our work, consider supporting us!\n\n👉 Support us on Patreon\n\n⚠️ This game contains adult content intended for players 18 years of age or older.\n\n✓ I am 18 or older - Enter Game\n✗ I am NOT 18 or older\n\nDeveloped by NutGames\n\n👉 Support us on Patreon","body_html":"<div class=\"game-intro\"> <h1>Last Call</h1> <p class=\"game-description\">Nina inherits The Last Call, her late uncle's failing dive bar — and the debt he owed to the man who really owns the block. The bartender came with the building and knows where every body is buried. A regular with money keeps tipping like he's buying something. The cook runs the kitchen like it's hers. The supplier sets his own terms. And every week, the collector knocks. Keep the lights on, or lose the only thing she's got left.</p> <div class=\"developer-intro\"> <p class=\"developer-about\">We're a small indie studio crafting intimate, story-driven experiences. Every game is made with care, and your support helps us keep creating. If you enjoy our work, consider supporting us!</p> <p class=\"support-link\">👉 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/nutgames844\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"link-external\" tabindex=\"-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Support us on Patreon</a></p> </div> <div class=\"age-gate\"> <p class=\"a