{"ts":1780482116273,"state_hash":"06faeb3d285353ff","passage":"CustomizeCharacters","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Customize Characters\n\nPersonalize the characters in your story.\n\nYOUR CHARACTER\n\nMid-thirties. Came back to town for the funeral and left holding the keys to a bar that loses money and a debt she didn't sign for. Tending bar is the one thing she actually knows how to do.\n\nYOUR NAME\nBUILD\npetite\naverage\ncurvy\nathletic\nthick\nLOOK\nWorn out\nGuarded\nSharp\nContinue to Game\n\n\n","body_html":"<div class=\"customize-page\"> <h2>Customize Characters</h2> <p class=\"customize-intro\">Personalize the characters in your story.</p> <h3 class=\"customize-section-title\">Your Character</h3> <div class=\"customize-player\"> <p class=\"customize-description\">Mid-thirties. Came back to town for the funeral and left holding the keys to a bar that loses money and a debt she didn't sign for. Tending bar is the one thing she actually knows how to do.</p> <div class=\"customize-field\"> <label>Your name</label> <input id=\"textbox-playername\" name=\"textbox-playername\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"macro-textbox\"> </div> <div class=\"customize-field\"> <label>Build</label> <select id=\"listbox-playerbody-type\" name=\"listbox-playerbody-type\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"macro-listbox\"><option value=\"0\">petite</option><option value=\"1\">average</option><option value=\"2\">curvy</option><option value=\"3\">athletic</option><option value=\"4\">thick</option></select> </div> <div class=\"customize-field\"> <label>Look</label> <div class=\"player-img-grid\"> <div class=\"player-img-option player-img-selected\" data-field=\"look\" data-value=\"tired\" data-image=\"players/nina_tired.jpg\" data-sets-portrait=\"true\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"Worn out\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" style=\"display: none;\"><span class=\"player-img-label\">Worn out</span></div><div class=\"player-img-option \" data-field=\"look\" data-value=\"guarded\" data-image=\"players/nina_guarded.jpg\" data-sets-portrait=\"true\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"Guarded\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" style=\"display: none;\"><span class=\"player-img-label\">Guarded</span></div><div class=\"player-img-option \" data-field=\"look\" data-value=\"sharp\" data-image=\"players/nina_sharp.jpg\" data-sets-portrait=\"true\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"Sharp\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" style=\"display: none;\"><span class=\"player-img-label\">Sharp</span></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"customize-actions\"> <a data-passage=\"StartingCanvas_canvas_first_night_Node_1\" class=\"link-internal\" tabindex=\"0\">Continue to Game</a> </div> </div><br><br><style>\n.customize-page {\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px;\n}\n.customize-page h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n}\n.customize-intro {\n    text-align: center;\n    opacity: 0.7;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n    font-size: 0.9em;\n}\n.customize-section-title {\n    margin: 20px 0 10px;\n    opacity: 0.6;\n    font-size: 0.9em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n.customize-npc, .customize-player {\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n.customize-npc-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n.customize-portrait {\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 60px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n}\n.customize-portrait-placeholder {\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 60px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n}\n.customize-npc-default-name {\n    font-size: 1.2em;\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n.customize-description {\n    font-size: 0.9em;\n    opacity: 0.75;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n}\n.customize-field {\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.customize-field label {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 0.85em;\n    opacity: 0.7;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n.customize-field input[type=\"text\"] {\n    width: 100%;\n    min-width: 0;\n    max-width: 100%;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    color: inherit;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n.customize-field select {\n    width: 100%;\n    min-width: 0;\n    max-width: 100%;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    color: inherit;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n.customize-actions {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 25px;\n}\n.customize-actions a {\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 12px 30px;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-size: 1.1em;\n    transition: background 0.2s;\n}\n.customize-actions a:hover {\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n}\n.player-img-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(120px, 1fr));\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n}\n.player-img-option {\n    cursor: pointer;\n    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    text-align: center;\n    transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.1s;\n    padding: 4px;\n}\n.player-img-option:hover {\n    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n    transform: scale(1.03);\n}\n.player-img-option.player-img-selected {\n    border-color: var(--theme-primary);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--theme-primary-bg);\n}\n.player-img-option img {\n    width: 100%;\n    aspect-ratio: 3/4;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n}\n.player-img-label {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 0.8em;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    opacity: 0.8;\n}\n</style>","modal_text":null,"variables_snapshot":{"last_game_passage":"CustomizeCharacters","player":{"name":"Nina","portrait":"nina.jpg","current_location":"","core_traits":{"corruption":0,"arousal":0,"energy":100,"hygiene":100,"money":80,"sal_stage":0,"marcus_stage":0,"dee_stage":0,"rosa_stage":0,"fitness":0,"beauty":0,"exhibitionism":0,"pregnancy":0},"wardrobe":{},"equipped":{"bra":null,"underwear":null,"top":null,"bottom":null,"dress":null,"legwear":null,"shoes":null},"body_type":"average","look":"tired"},"npcs":{"c34a8f8b-3b88-48ae-87c1-34eced4340bf":{"name":"Sal","portrait":"sal.jpg","core_traits":{"arousal":0,"corruption":0,"relation":0},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""},"2c6a3a55-c898-4fda-a2cc-2097c83bcad7":{"name":"Marcus","portrait":"marcus.jpg","core_traits":{"arousal":0,"corruption":0,"relation":0},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""},"301fb2b2-bf8f-49e0-8b3a-8d0c297daded":{"name":"The Collector","portrait":"collector.jpg","core_traits":{"awareness":0,"corruption":0,"relation":0},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""},"67db224e-c3d5-4604-98b1-247dc81ff3a8":{"name":"Rosa","portrait":"rosa.jpg","core_traits":{"relation":0},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""},"52f53ef7-1528-4765-a511-c96045204541":{"name":"Dee","portrait":"dee.jpg","core_traits":{"arousal":0,"corruption":0,"relation":0},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""}},"npc_interacted_today":{},"flags":{"bar_seized":false,"game_started":true,"debug_mode":false},"flags_meta":{},"game_state":{"current_canvas":"","visited_locations":[],"visited_nodes":[],"trigger_history":{},"activity_trigger_history":{},"visited_choices":{},"active_modifiers":{},"random_cooldowns":{},"stage_advancement_log":{},"quests":{},"scheduled":[],"fast_jobs":{"xp":0,"cooldowns":{}},"bank":{"balance":0},"time_state":{"current_hour":18,"current_minute":0,"current_day":"Monday","current_week":1,"day":1},"rent_state":{"last_paid_week":1,"warnings":0,"is_due":false}}},"session":1,"kind":"branch","entered_via":null}
{"ts":1780482116740,"state_hash":"e9a3718d215b267c","passage":"StartingCanvas_canvas_first_night_Node_1","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Canvas: First night (canvas_first_night) | Node: First night\n\n\n\nThe keys still have his keyring on them — a bottle opener worn smooth and a faded tag that says NOT THE GOOD WHISKEY in his handwriting. The lock sticks the way he always said it did. Inside, the dark smells exactly like it did when you were nineteen and he let you sit at the end of the bar with a Coke and watch him work.\n\nYou find the lights behind the register. The Last Call comes up around you one buzzing fixture at a time — the cracked booths, the dead letter in the beer sign, the jukebox squatting in the corner like it's waiting to be asked.\n\nA man is wiping down the taps like he never stopped. Big, grey, a towel on his shoulder. He doesn't startle when the lights come on. He just looks at you the way you'd look at weather you'd been expecting.\n\nYou'd be Sully's niece. He talked about you. I'm Sal — I pour, I lock up, I been doing both since before you could see over the bar.\n\nAsk about the envelope by the register.\n\n\n\n\n","body_html":"<div class=\"dev-canvas-info\"><strong>Canvas:</strong> First night <span style=\"opacity:0.7;\">(canvas_first_night)</span> | <strong>Node:</strong> First night</div><br><p>The keys still have his keyring on them — a bottle opener worn smooth and a faded tag that says NOT THE GOOD WHISKEY in his handwriting. The lock sticks the way he always said it did. Inside, the dark smells exactly like it did when you were nineteen and he let you sit at the end of the bar with a Coke and watch him work.</p><p>You find the lights behind the register. The Last Call comes up around you one buzzing fixture at a time — the cracked booths, the dead letter in the beer sign, the jukebox squatting in the corner like it's waiting to be asked.</p><span id=\"cascade-641f41d1-1b53-4d39-b01f-b1bba94650c4-beat-0\"><p>A man is wiping down the taps like he never stopped. Big, grey, a towel on his shoulder. He doesn't startle when the lights come on. He just looks at you the way you'd look at weather you'd been expecting.</p><p>You'd be Sully's niece. He talked about you. I'm Sal — I pour, I lock up, I been doing both since before you could see over the bar.</p><span id=\"cascade-641f41d1-1b53-4d39-b01f-b1bba94650c4-beat-1\"><a class=\"link-internal macro-linkreplace\" tabindex=\"0\">Ask about the envelope by the register.</a><span class=\"macro-linkreplace-insert\"></span></span></span><br><br><br><br><br>","modal_text":null,"variables_snapshot":{"last_game_passage":"StartingCanvas_canvas_first_night_Node_1","player":{"name":"Nina","portrait":"nina.jpg","current_location":"","core_traits":{"corruption":0,"arousal":0,"energy":100,"hygiene":100,"money":80,"sal_stage":0,"marcus_stage":0,"dee_stage":0,"rosa_stage":0,"fitness":0,"beauty":0,"exhibitionism":0,"pregnancy":0},"wardrobe":{},"equipped":{"bra":null,"underwear":null,"top":null,"bottom":null,"dress":null,"legwear":null,"shoes":null},"body_type":"average","look":"tired"},"npcs":{"c34a8f8b-3b88-48ae-87c1-34eced4340bf":{"name":"Sal","portrait":"sal.jpg","core_traits":{"arousal":0,"corruption":0,"relation":0},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""},"2c6a3a55-c898-4fda-a2cc-2097c83bcad7":{"name":"Marcus","portrait":"marcus.jpg","core_traits":{"arousal":0,"corruption":0,"relation":0},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""},"301fb2b2-bf8f-49e0-8b3a-8d0c297daded":{"name":"The Collector","portrait":"collector.jpg","core_traits":{"awareness":0,"corruption":0,"relation":0},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""},"67db224e-c3d5-4604-98b1-247dc81ff3a8":{"name":"Rosa","portrait":"rosa.jpg","core_traits":{"relation":0},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""},"52f53ef7-1528-4765-a511-c96045204541":{"name":"Dee","portrait":"dee.jpg","core_traits":{"arousal":0,"corruption":0,"relation":0},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""}},"npc_interacted_today":{},"flags":{"bar_seized":false,"game_started":true,"debug_mode":false},"flags_meta":{},"game_state":{"current_canvas":"9e2e7933-da66-477f-8abd-9bd3c2362e47","visited_locations":[],"visited_nodes":["canvas_first_night.intro"],"trigger_history":{"9e2e7933-da66-477f-8abd-9bd3c2362e47":{"total":1,"dayKey":"1:Monday","dayCount":1}},"activity_trigger_history":{},"visited_choices":{},"active_modifiers":{},"random_cooldowns":{},"stage_advancement_log":{},"quests":{},"scheduled":[],"fast_jobs":{"xp":0,"cooldowns":{}},"bank":{"balance":0},"time_state":{"current_hour":18,"current_minute":0,"current_day":"Monday","current_week":1,"day":1},"rent_state":{"last_paid_week":1,"warnings":0,"is_due":false},"current_node":"6649e4a0-b783-4514-8734-cbac4be1d793"}},"session":1,"kind":"branch","entered_via":"Continue to Game"}
{"ts":1780482117552,"state_hash":"48bba2401bc3ab35","passage":"Canvas_canvas_shark_summons_Node_1","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Canvas: The Last Call — a message from Boyd (canvas_shark_summons) | Node: He wants to see you\n\n\n\nThe Collector takes the cash like always, but this time he doesn't leave after. He sets a card on the bar — an address three blocks off Main, no name on it — and taps it once with a finger like a man closing a deal you didn't agree to.\n\nMr. Boyd likes to meet the people who owe him, now you're the one who does. That's a courtesy, by the way — he doesn't usually. Tomorrow. Bring yourself, not excuses.\n\n💭 You are thinking: Now I know where he lives. I don't think that's good news for me.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTake the card.\n","body_html":"<div class=\"dev-canvas-info\"><strong>Canvas:</strong> The Last Call — a message from Boyd <span style=\"opacity:0.7;\">(canvas_shark_summons)</span> | <strong>Node:</strong> He wants to see you</div><br><p>The Collector takes the cash like always, but this time he doesn't leave after. He sets a card on the bar — an address three blocks off Main, no name on it — and taps it once with a finger like a man closing a deal you didn't agree to.</p><p>Mr. Boyd likes to meet the people who owe him, now you're the one who does. That's a courtesy, by the way — he doesn't usually. Tomorrow. Bring yourself, not excuses.</p><div class=\"thought-bubble thought-bubble-player\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></circle><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></ellipse></svg></div><div class=\"thought-bubble-content\"><em>💭 You are thinking:</em> Now I know where he lives. I don't think that's good news for me.</div></div><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><a data-passage=\"Location_The_Last_Call\" class=\"link-internal macro-link\" tabindex=\"0\">Take the card.</a><br>","modal_text":null,"var