{"ts":1780482175797,"state_hash":"b32823eb806b3b64","passage":"Canvas_canvas_sal_ropes_first_Node_1","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Canvas: The Last Call — Sal (canvas_sal_ropes_first) | Node: Working the bar\n\n\n\nSal doesn't ask if you know what you're doing. He just slides down the bar to make room and starts talking — which tap pours foam until you crack the line, which regular runs a tab and which one you cut off at three, where Sully kept the good stuff and why nobody's allowed to touch it.\n\nYou keep up. You've poured in worse rooms than this. Somewhere around the second rush he stops narrating and just works beside you, and that's its own kind of test passed — the quiet one, where he decides you're not going to embarrass the place.\n\nHuh. You've done this. Sully said you tended in the city. I figured he was bragging.\n\n💭 You are thinking: First thing today that felt like solid ground.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLet him show you how Sully ran the place.\n","body_html":"<div class=\"dev-canvas-info\"><strong>Canvas:</strong> The Last Call — Sal <span style=\"opacity:0.7;\">(canvas_sal_ropes_first)</span> | <strong>Node:</strong> Working the bar</div><br><p>Sal doesn't ask if you know what you're doing. He just slides down the bar to make room and starts talking — which tap pours foam until you crack the line, which regular runs a tab and which one you cut off at three, where Sully kept the good stuff and why nobody's allowed to touch it.</p><p>You keep up. You've poured in worse rooms than this. Somewhere around the second rush he stops narrating and just works beside you, and that's its own kind of test passed — the quiet one, where he decides you're not going to embarrass the place.</p><p>Huh. You've done this. Sully said you tended in the city. I figured he was bragging.</p><div class=\"thought-bubble thought-bubble-player\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c75